###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/dread-plate
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/dread-plate> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
              <http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Plaque_arceus> ;
