###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/grassium-z--held
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/grassium-z--held> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
