###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/oran-berry
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/oran-berry> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
