###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/timer-ball
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/timer-ball> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
             <http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Objet> ;
